      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T01:34:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks Geoff@ for reviewing!\n\n\u003e(Render|Compute)Pipeline::InitializeImpl also initializes the layout with an internalImmediateDataSize of kClampFragDepthArgsSize\n\nSry but I find that the logic of ComputePipelineVk could be optimized. Only RenderPipeline initializes the layout with `kClampFragDepthArgsSize` internalImmediateDataSize and ComputePipeline doesn\u0027t need it.",
      "parentUuid": "9cf59d80_02bc22d6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
        "startChar": 61,
        "endLine": 114,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "ef17bb99ec64a35957ac52926f923a0fbca4f2bf",
